<div id="about" class="modal hidden"><div class="ab-box">
  <button class="ab-x" id="abX" aria-label="Close">✕</button>
  <div class="ab-hero"><a class="ab-tg" id="abTgImg" href="https://t.me/+JJ7WkMOsvsM4YmFl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Join Combat Horizens on Telegram"><img id="abEm" alt="Combat Horizens on Telegram"><i>Telegram</i></a><div><div class="ab-t">COMBAT HORIZENS</div><div class="ab-s">TACTICAL SHOOTER · PATCH 0.9 BETA</div><span class="ab-links"><a class="btn ab-tgb" id="abTgBtn" href="https://t.me/+JJ7WkMOsvsM4YmFl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">✈ Join us on Telegram</a><a class="btn ab-tgb ab-ph" id="abPhBtn" href="https://www.producthunt.com/products/combat-horizens" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▲ Support us on Product Hunt</a></span></div></div>
  <p class="ab-lead">Combat Horizens is a fast tactical first-person shooter that runs right in your browser — one file, no install. Drop into sun-baked streets, outplay bots or friends, and climb from Recruit to the Combat Horizens rank.</p>
  <div class="ab-grid">
    <div class="ab-c"><b>🎯 5 Modes</b><span>Bomb Defusal, Team Deathmatch, Free For All, Battle Royale and Target Practice — vs bots or online with friends.</span></div>
    <div class="ab-c"><b>🗺️ 7 Maps</b><span>Dunehold, Exclusion Zone, Lost Temple, Oasis, Pharaoh, Reactor and Vineyard, picked at random each match.</span></div>
    <div class="ab-c"><b>🔫 45+ Weapons</b><span>Pistols, SMGs, rifles, snipers, machine guns and shotguns — each with its own recoil, weight, spray pattern and sound.</span></div>
    <div class="ab-c"><b>⚔️ Blades</b><span>Real knives, one-shot backstabs, and katanas that deflect bullets back at the shooter.</span></div>
    <div class="ab-c"><b>💣 Grenades</b><span>HE, Flashbang, Smoke, Molotov, Incendiary and Fire Bomb with real bounce physics.</span></div>
    <div class="ab-c"><b>🧠 Smart Enemies</b><span>Rushers, armored Heavies and Tactical soldiers who take cover and throw grenades.</span></div>
    <div class="ab-c"><b>🛡️ Tactical Play</b><span>Manual reloads, ammo crates, leaning around corners and sandbag cover.</span></div>
    <div class="ab-c"><b>🏆 Progression</b><span>500 levels, ranks, medals, skins, cases, a store and redeem codes.</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ab-keys"><span><kbd>WASD</kbd> move</span><span><kbd>Space</kbd> jump</span><span><kbd>Q</kbd> slide</span><span><kbd>R</kbd> reload</span><span><kbd>H</kbd> medkit</span><span><kbd>Z</kbd>/<kbd>X</kbd> lean</span><span><kbd>4</kbd> grenades</span><span><kbd>F</kbd> inspect</span><span><kbd>V</kbd> 3rd person</span><span><kbd>B</kbd> buy</span><span><kbd>Tab</kbd> scores</span></div>
  <div class="ab-gift"><div class="ab-gl">🎁 SECRET CODE FOR EXPLORERS</div><div class="ab-gc"><span id="abCode">HORIZENS</span><button class="btn" id="abCopy">Copy</button><button class="btn pri" id="abClaim">Claim 200 coins</button></div><div id="abMsg"></div></div>
  <div class="ab-lic"><button class="btn" id="abLicBtn">License &amp; credits</button><pre id="abLic" class="hidden"></pre></div>
  <div class="ab-made"><span class="ab-line"></span><div>MADE BY</div><b>PRATIK</b><span class="ab-line"></span></div>
</div></div>
<div id="welcome" class="modal hidden"><div class="mbox wide" style="text-align:center">
  <h3>WELCOME, RECRUIT</h3><div class="sub" style="color:var(--dim)">Your starter kit is in your inventory</div>
  <div class="wc-items" id="wcItems"></div>
  <div class="note">You spawn with the AK-47 (switch to the AWP in Loadout) , a pistol and your 4 starter grenades in Team Deathmatch, Free For All and Target Practice. Knife, Classic Knife and Bayonet are unlocked from level 1.</div>
  <div style="margin-top:14px"><button class="btn pri" id="wcOk">Let's go</button></div>
</div></div>
<div id="settings" class="modal hidden"><div class="mbox setbox">
  <div class="sethead"><h3>Settings</h3><button class="btn pri" id="setClose">Done</button></div>
  <nav class="stabs"><button data-tabk="game" class="on">Game</button><button data-tabk="video">Video</button><button data-tabk="ctl">Controller &amp; touch</button><button data-tabk="xh">Crosshair</button><button data-tabk="app">App</button></nav>
  <div class="spanes">
  <section class="sp on" data-sp="game">
    <div class="sgrp">Aim</div>
    <label>Mouse sensitivity <span id="vSens"></span><input type="range" id="sSens" min="0.2" max="3" step="0.05"></label>
    <label>Field of view <span id="vFov"></span><input type="range" id="sFov" min="65" max="105" step="1"></label>
    <label>Aim assist <select id="sAim" style="float:right"><option value="auto">Auto — controller, mobile, app &amp; below level 15</option><option value="on">Always on</option><option value="off">Off</option></select></label>
    <div class="sgrp">Weapons</div>
    <label>Reload <select id="sReload" style="float:right"><option value="auto">Auto — press R once</option><option value="manual">Manual — R: drop · insert · chamber</option></select></label>
    <label>Weapon weight affects speed <select id="sWeight" style="float:right"><option value="off">Off — same speed with every weapon</option><option value="normal">Normal — heavy guns a bit slower</option><option value="real">Realistic — heavy guns much slower, knife fastest</option></select></label>
    <div class="note" id="sWeightNote" style="margin:-6px 0 10px"></div>
    <label>Auto-reload when the magazine is empty <input type="checkbox" id="sAutoEmpty" style="float:right;accent-color:var(--acc)"></label>
    <div class="sgrp">Sound &amp; screen</div>
  <label>Announcer voice (round start, bomb planted, who won) <input type="checkbox" id="sAnn" style="float:right;accent-color:var(--acc)"></label>
  <label>3D positional sound (best with headphones) <input type="checkbox" id="s3d" style="float:right;accent-color:var(--acc)"></label>
  <label>Menu sounds <input type="checkbox" id="sUiS" style="float:right;accent-color:var(--acc)"></label>
    <label>Volume <span id="vVol"></span><input type="range" id="sVol" min="0" max="1" step="0.05"></label>
    <label>Music (loading screen &amp; lobby) <select id="sMusic" style="float:right"><option value="on">On</option><option value="off">Off</option></select></label>
    <label>Music volume <span id="vMus"></span><input type="range" id="sMusVol" min="0" max="1" step="0.05"></label>
    <label>Damage numbers <input type="checkbox" id="sDmg" style="float:right;accent-color:var(--acc)"></label>
    <label>Blood effects <input type="checkbox" id="sBlood" style="float:right;accent-color:var(--acc)"></label>
   <label>Show FPS <input type="checkbox" id="sFps" style="float:right;accent-color:var(--acc)"></label>
    <div class="sgrp">Profile</div>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px"><span class="note" id="sProf" style="margin:0"></span><button class="btn" id="sEditProf">Edit profile</button></div>
  </section>
  <section class="sp" data-sp="video">
    <div class="vid-h">VIDEO <button class="btn" id="vPreset">Competitive preset</button></div>
    <label>Graphics <select id="sQual" style="float:right"><option value="high">High (best looking)</option><option value="auto">Auto (lowers itself if the game is slow)</option><option value="medium">Medium</option><option value="low">Low</option></select></label>
    <div id="vidBox"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="sp" data-sp="ctl">
    <div class="vid-h">CONTROLLER <span id="gpSt" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.05em"></span></div>
  <label>Controller look speed <span id="vPsens"></span><input type="range" id="sPsens" min="0.3" max="2.5" step="0.05"></label>
  <label>Stick dead zone <span id="vPdz"></span><input type="range" id="sPdz" min="0.06" max="0.4" step="0.01"></label>
  <div class="note" id="gpLive" style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px"></div>
  <label>Invert look up/down <input type="checkbox" id="sPinv" style="float:right;accent-color:var(--acc)"></label>
  <label>Controller vibration <input type="checkbox" id="sPvib" style="float:right;accent-color:var(--acc)"></label>
  <button class="btn" id="sPadHelp" style="width:100%;margin:4px 0 8px">🎮 Show controller layout</button>
    <div class="sgrp">Touch screen</div>
    <label>Touch controls (beta) <select id="sTouch"><option value="auto">Auto — phones &amp; tablets</option><option value="on">Always on</option><option value="off">Off</option></select></label>
  <label>Touch button size <span id="vTsize"></span><input type="range" id="sTsize" min="0.7" max="1.4" step="0.05"></label>
  <label>Touch look speed <span id="vTsens"></span><input type="range" id="sTsens" min="0.4" max="2.5" step="0.05"></label>
  <button class="btn" id="sTlay" style="width:100%;margin:8px 0">✋ Customize touch layout (move &amp; resize buttons)</button>
  </section>
  <section class="sp" data-sp="xh">
    
  <div class="xh-prev"><div id="xhP" class="st-crossdot"><i class="t"></i><i class="b"></i><i class="l"></i><i class="r"></i><i class="d"></i><i class="c"></i></div></div>
  <div class="xh-row" id="xhStyles"><button data-st="cross">✛<span>Cross</span></button><button data-st="dot">•<span>Dot</span></button><button data-st="circle">◯<span>Circle</span></button><button data-st="crossdot">⊹<span>Cross + Dot</span></button></div>
  <div class="xh-row" id="xhCols"><button data-c="#ffffff"><i class="sw" style="background:#fff"></i>White</button><button data-c="#4dff88"><i class="sw" style="background:#4dff88"></i>Green</button><button data-c="#3ee8ff"><i class="sw" style="background:#3ee8ff"></i>Cyan</button><button data-c="#ffb020"><i class="sw" style="background:#ffb020"></i>Amber</button><button data-c="#ff4646"><i class="sw" style="background:#ff4646"></i>Red</button></div>
  <label>Custom colour <input type="color" id="sXh"></label>
  </section>
  <section class="sp" data-sp="app">
    <div id="updBox"><div class="upd-h">APP UPDATES <span id="updVer"></span></div>
  <label>Update server <input id="sUpd" placeholder="https://yourname.github.io/combat-horizens" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off"></label>
  <div class="upd-row"><button class="btn" id="sUpdBtn">Check for updates</button><span id="sUpdSt"></span></div></div>
  </section>
  </div>
</div></div>

